+#!/usr/bin/env bash
+# slice-check — rerun a slice's done-when command and check its diff against
+# the card: a changed file outside --files fails, and so does a test file with
+# fewer cases or assertions, or new skip/only markers. Logic: lib/slice-check.ts.
